===========================================================================
AUDIO / TTS (build-time only, not distributed)
===========================================================================

The app's audio assets are rendered offline by this repository's content
pipeline. No TTS engine or model is shipped in the app; only the rendered
.ogg clips are delivered.

Kokoro (kokoro)
  Source:      https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro
  Copyright:   hexgrad and contributors
  License:     Apache-2.0 (see licenses/Apache-2.0.txt)
  Used as:     reference voice generation. tools/content/make_voice_refs.py
               renders every reference clip with Kokoro, so the references in
               tools/content/voices/ are fully synthetic and no real person's
               voice is cloned.

Chatterbox (chatterbox-tts)
  Source:      https://github.com/resemble-ai/chatterbox
  Copyright:   Resemble AI
  License:     MIT (see licenses/MIT.txt)
  Used as:     rendering the app's audio assets, cloning each voice from the
               Kokoro-generated reference above.

Perth (resemble-perth)
  Source:      https://github.com/resemble-ai/Perth
  Copyright:   Resemble AI
  License:     MIT (see licenses/MIT.txt)
  Used as:     implicit audio watermarker that Chatterbox embeds into every
               generated clip.

