===========================================================================
CHANGES
===========================================================================

The wav2vec2 model is used unmodified except for the standard fp16 ONNX
conversion performed by onnx-community. No third-party component is modified
by Glosso Pro.

This NOTICE is a summary. The app itself ships the machine-readable catalogue at
assets/licenses.json, generated from the **resolved runtime classpath** (not only
the declared dependencies) plus the curated attribution list. Each artifact's
licence comes from the POM declared by its publisher; the Gradle task
`:androidApp:licensesRuntimeClasspath` keeps the lock and `preBuild` fails if it
drifts. The About screen renders the catalogue, so the attribution travels inside
the APK and does not depend on this repository being reachable.
tools/licensing/collect_test.py fails if a runtime artifact has no entry.
